2026-09-27T13:20:14.1614157Z [36;1m# POSITIVE CONTROL. `maintenance:install` can exit 0 having fallen back[0m
2026-09-27T13:20:14.1614668Z [36;1m# to a different backend, and a suite that passes on sqlite while the[0m
