2026-09-27T13:25:47.3373463Z [36;1m# A RELEASE PROMOTION HAS NO RATCHET TO RUN, AND ITS BASE CANNOT BOOT.[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3373557Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3373794Z [36;1m# This step runs the BASE's test suite inside the HEAD's environment.[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3373931Z [36;1m# `server/` is checked out once, at[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3374162Z [36;1m# `needs.nextcloud-matrix.outputs.single-server` (the numerically[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3374399Z [36;1m# highest stable branch), and is never moved when the app is rewound[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3374615Z [36;1m# to the merge base. For a feature branch that is harmless: the merge[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3374807Z [36;1m# base is days old, and base and head agree about which Nextcloud[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3375057Z [36;1m# they are written against. For a `development -> beta` promotion the[0m
2026-09-27T13:25:47.3375263Z [36;1m# merge base is the PREVIOUS RELEASE POINT, a whole cycle behind, and[0m
